@startuml
' ============================================================
' UC-01: View Wallet Balance - Sequence Diagram
' ============================================================

title UC-01: View Wallet Balance

actor User
participant "Wallet UI" as UI
participant "Wallet API" as API
database "Wallet DB" as DB
participant "AUTH Service" as AUTH

== View Wallet Balance ==

User -> UI: Access wallet page
UI -> API: GET /wallet/balance
API -> AUTH: Validate JWT token
AUTH --> API: Token valid (user_id)

API -> DB: SELECT * FROM wallet_wallets WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> API: Wallet data

alt Wallet exists
  API --> UI: 200 OK { balance, currency, status }
  UI --> User: Display wallet balance
else No wallet
  API --> UI: 404 Not Found
  UI --> User: "No wallet found"
end

@enduml